{
  // Type gate for the ported visualizer tree.
  //
  // `src/original-folia-visualizers` is excluded from the main tsconfig (and the exclusion is
  // transitive: a file that is only reached *through* the excluded folder is not checked either).
  // Layer A put the shared Pixi modules under `tsconfig.pixi.json`; this project covers the
  // Tempera port and everything it pulls in, so a ported mode is not a type-checking blind spot.
  //
  // `wordGlow.ts` and `utils/glowBlurQuantize.ts` are listed explicitly because the glyph-cache leak
  // fix spans both trees: the shared switch lives under the (excluded) `src/utils`, and classic,
  // partita, claddagh and cadenza all read it. Without these two entries the fix itself would be a
  // type-checking blind spot.
  //
  // Known pre-existing debt: none. `KNOWN_DEBT` in scripts/check-visualizer-types.mjs is empty and
  // this project reports 0 errors.
  //
  // An earlier revision of this comment claimed `src/types.ts` imported three type modules that do
  // not exist (`./types/onlineMusic`, `./types/localLibrary`, `./types/localCover`), and that the
  // types were only used by "`src/utils/**`, which is dead code left over from an earlier port".
  // Both claims are now wrong, and the second one was misleading in a way worth spelling out:
  //
  //   - All three modules exist: `src/types/onlineMusic.ts` (404 lines),
  //     `src/types/localLibrary.ts` (66), `src/types/localCover.ts` (26). `src/types.ts` imports
  //     them at lines 2, 1219-1227 and 1321-1327, and the main `tsc` run resolves them cleanly.
  //   - `src/utils/**` is not dead code. It is excluded from *type checking* by `tsconfig.json`,
  //     which is a different thing. After WP1a deleted the 77 genuinely unreachable files
  //     (commit `aafd5c5`), 415 of 432 product files are reachable and `src/utils` is overwhelmingly
  //     live code that simply is not checked. Read "excluded" as "unchecked", never as "unused" -
  //     conflating the two is what let the sonnet `measureText` ReferenceError (§3.3 of
  //     docs/echora-vs-folia-gap-and-plan.md) sit unnoticed on a live code path.
  //
  // WP1d should shrink this file's `include` list to nothing by lifting the exclusions in
  // `tsconfig.json` instead, once the remaining 89 errors are cleared.
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "include": [
    "src/vite-env.d.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/loadPixi.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/pixiFilterPoolCompat.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/pixiRuntimeHost.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/pixiDisplayResources.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/subtitleFontSizes.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/songHandover.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/definition.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/tuningAdapter.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/tuningRegistry.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/wordGlow.ts",
    "src/utils/glowBlurQuantize.ts",
    "src/utils/glowBlurQuantize.test.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/*/tuning.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/*.test.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/*.test.tsx",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/tempera/**/*.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/tempera/**/*.tsx",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/lumiere/**/*.ts",
    "src/original-folia-visualizers/lumiere/**/*.tsx"
  ],
  "exclude": []
}
